OL,3,AMeta hooked children on Facebook and
OL,4,AInstagram, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA court has heard claims Meta
OL,7,Fintentionally hooked a generation of
OL,8,Fchildren on Facebook and Instagram, as
OL,9,Fthe biggest legal challenge the social
OL,10,Fmedia platform has faced began on
OL,11,FTuesday.
OL,13,FA jury in Oakland, California will
OL,14,Fspend the next six weeks wading through
OL,15,Fclaims by top attorneys from several US
OL,16,Fstates, and lawyers for the social
OL,17,Fmedia company, that at turns rebutted
OL,18,Fthe other as the trial opened.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
