OL,3,AMeta hooked children on Facebook and
OL,4,AInstagram, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lawyer for California claimed Meta
OL,7,Ffound "millions" of 11 and 12-year-olds
OL,8,Fwere on Instagram and "it did little to
OL,9,Fkeep them off".
OL,11,FMeta's representative said just over
OL,12,F100,000 such users were found, and also
OL,13,Fargued that social media addiction does
OL,14,Fnot exist.
